---
import ContactLinks from '../components/ContactLinks.astro';
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { site } from '../site.config';
---

<BaseLayout title="About" type="profile">
  <article class="prose">
    <header class="page-head">
      <h1>About</h1>
    </header>

    <p>
      I am a {site.role} in physics in the {site.affiliation.department} at the{' '}
      <a href={site.affiliation.url}>{site.affiliation.name}</a> in Leipzig, and a member of the
      International Max Planck Research School on Cognitive NeuroImaging (IMPRS CoNI). I started my
      PhD in 2024.
    </p>

    <h2>Research</h2>
    <p>
      I am interested in getting more out of pretrained models after training: test-time adaptation,
      inference-time computation and reasoning, and continual adaptation. My current work develops
      these ideas for frozen diffusion models, with simulation-based inference and inverse problems
      as testbeds.
    </p>
    <p>
      My PhD project is on deep image reconstruction for fast, ultra-high-resolution MRI. It has
      given me hands-on experience with real forward models, acquisition constraints, and large
      experiments on HPC systems.
    </p>

    <h2>Background</h2>
    <p>
      Before my PhD, I studied automation (BSc, 2021) and control science and engineering (MSc,
      2024) at the Beijing Institute of Technology, where I worked on medical image analysis:
      cardiac MRI segmentation and machine-learning assessment of pulmonary hypertension from CT
      pulmonary angiography.
    </p>

    <h2>Contact</h2>
    <p>
      The best way to reach me is by email at <a href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>{site.email}</a>.
    </p>
    <ContactLinks />
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
